ck position 3 7cm superomedial to mass  2  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm ill defined  tan white yellow  firm mass  which lies 2 0cm to the anterior margin  and 1 1cm from the posterior margin  A clip is identified within mass  3  Mass  4  which lies 5 2cm inferomedial to mass  3  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm ill defined  tan white  firm mass  which lies 1 0cm to the anterior margin  and 1 0cm from the posterior margin  Mass  5 lies 3 8cm inferior to mass  4 and is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm ill defined tan white firm mass which lies 4 2cm from the anterior margin   2 2cm from the posterior margin  Mass  6 lies 0 5cm superior to mass  5 and consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan white stellate mass which lies 1 0cm from the anterior margin and 3 3cm from the posterior margin  Mass  7  which lies 2 1cm posterior to mass  6  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm ill defined yellow tan mass  which lies 3 8cm from the anterior margin and 0 8cm from the posterior margin  Mass  8 lies 3 4cm superior to mass  7 and consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm ill defined tan white mass which lies 1 5cm from the posterior margin  and grossly abuts the anterior margin  Mass  9 lies 6 8cm inferomedial to mass  8 and consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm well circumscribed tan white firm mass which lies 1 3cm from the posterior margin and 3 6cm from the anterior margin  Mass  10 lies 2 4cm superior to mass  9 and consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm firm tan white ill defined mass  and lies 4 3cm from the anterior margin and 1 7cm from the posterior margin  The remainder of the specimen is composed of yellow lobulated adipose tissue with areas of dense tan white focally nodular rubbery fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  1  entirely submitted   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Uninvolved between mass  1    2   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  2  entire